# The schema, vectors and protocol document are hashed byte-for-byte by
# `vectors/recall_envelope_v2/MANIFEST.sha256`, and by AEON-IQ when it vendors
# them (S0.1b). Their bytes must therefore be identical on every platform.
#
# Without these rules a checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites them to
# CRLF, changing every hash and failing the manifest test for a reason that has
# nothing to do with content.
schema/** text eol=lf
vectors/** text eol=lf

# Rust sources are LF for the same determinism reason, and because rustfmt
# output is compared in CI.
*.rs text eol=lf
